{"id":"632798","name":"麻酱花卷","author":"金凤栖梧","authorId":"8221247","desc":"","cover":"images/632798/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"500g"},{"name":"温水","amount":"280g"},{"name":"酵母粉","amount":"6g"}],"sub":[{"name":"红糖","amount":"50g"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"50g"},{"name":"芝麻酱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"低筋粉","amount":"5g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"面粉和好发酵后，排气揉面。","img":"images/632798/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"红糖白糖、芝麻酱、低粉混匀。","img":"images/632798/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"擀成大长片。","img":"images/632798/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"铺上麻酱红糖，有点干了，再加点香油好了，下次注意。","img":"images/632798/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"卷起。","img":"images/632798/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"切开。","img":"images/632798/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"两个摞起压下。","img":"images/632798/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"再抻一下两边向后捏紧，放入抹油的蒸屉上再发酵15分钟，水开蒸16分钟焖3分钟。","img":"images/632798/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/632798/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/632798/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"还蒸了奶黄包。","img":"images/632798/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}